sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant G as Endpoint on the Pi
    participant S as Server
    participant C as EZKL CLI child
    U->>G: question x, 41-byte payload
    G->>G: parse, encode x like EZKL, check x is answerable
    alt malformed message
        G-->>U: connection closed, server never sees it
    else impossible x
        G-->>U: bad_request, server never sees it
    else admitted
        G->>G: assign seq, start deadline timer
        G->>S: seq, x
        S->>G: seq, outputs, proof
        G->>G: first answer for this seq only, proof exactly 3072 bytes
        G->>G: instances = own encoding of x + server outputs
        G->>C: verify instances and proof, time left as the limit
        C-->>G: ACCEPT, REJECT or ERROR
        alt ACCEPT before the deadline
            G-->>U: y decoded from the verified outputs, 34 bytes
        else anything else
            G-->>U: unavailable, 34 bytes
        end
    end
